StickySelect 1.3
-------------------

StickySelect is smart dropdown that won't require a user to hold CTRL key pressed while they select another option of the select-control.

Able Mind Works Inc.

Released under the MIT, BSD, and GPL Licenses.

https://www.ablemindworks.com
Issues: https://github.com/dharmavir/StickySelect/issues

Demo: Download and check examples folder

